	(text_box "Power can be supplied by USB or through the Power In connector.\n\nThis allows prototyping without a power supply, but no need for USB when in an enclosure and in production.\n\nPower is selected by the LM66200 which chooses the higher of the two values. Also provides reverse polarity protection and reverse flow as required."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 205.74 15.24 0)
		(size 78.105 63.5)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.25)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 229 191 1)
